  "title": "Aalto University: Designs for a Cooler Planet",
  "date": "2026-10-26T22:00:00.000Z",
  "content": "Aalto University: Designs for a Cooler Planet\n\nThis is my last night in Finland. I decide to go to Aalto University to see the English tour of their exhibition Design for a Cooler Planet.\n\nselfie\n\nThis is the project that uses waste material to make inks or foams.\nI found it interesting as the modern food chains/fashion chains are more profitable when making wastes.\nThis reuse method can be a valuable usage to ballance reusing waste and keep the products' price.\n\nwastes\n\nThis is using AI to build superconductor structure in normal temperature.\n\nSuper C\n\nThis is a special structure can handle weights.\n\nweights\n\nA visual for clinical data analysis.\n\nvisual",
